@example
(sum ?amount
     (and (job ?x (computer programmer))
          (salary ?x ?amount)))
@end example

In general, Ben's new system allows expressions of the form

@example
(accumulation-function ⟨@var{variable}⟩
                       ⟨@var{query pattern}⟩)
@end example

@noindent
where @code{accumulation-function} can be things like @code{sum},
